paths
├── when writing state
│   ├── it creates private parented files
│   ├── it restricts existing file permissions
│   └── it creates executable scripts
├── when reading logs
│   ├── it returns the last lines
│   └── it handles missing and empty files
├── when reading a pid file
│   ├── it recognizes the current process
│   └── it rejects malformed and missing files
└── when locating a program
    ├── it finds an existing absolute path
    └── it rejects a missing program
